{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303224","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303224","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430322401:1":{"text":"저, 저 이제 알아요! 인듀어 오빠가 여왕님을 죽였잖아요.","source_cn":"我、我就是知道！哥哥杀掉了女王。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC1904ECB982C2B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430322402:1":{"text":"여왕님이 없으니까 검은 옷을 입은 사람들이 여왕님 얘기를 안 하고 사람도 안 죽여요.","source_cn":"女王不在了，那些穿黑袍的人就不能提起女王，就不能杀人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F82F72384E5405A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:平民小女孩莫内":{"text":"평민 소녀 모네","source":"平民小女孩莫内","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}